1. GAME IDENTITY
============================================================

TITLE:
NO FIXED STARS

TAGLINE:
"A star should not move when you move."

GENRE:
Eldritch cosmic horror.
Surreal exploration.
Astronomical investigation.
Atmospheric 2D narrative adventure.

SETTING:

Nadir Observatory.
Nadir Plateau.
Elevation 4,120 metres.
October 28, 1926.

The protagonist, Dr. E. Vance, arrives at an isolated astronomical research facility to replace its missing director, Julian Vane.

The unfinished survey concerns an uncatalogued celestial object known as Nadir-IX.

It exhibits impossible parallax.

The player's investigation gradually reveals that the anomaly is not behaving like an astronomical object.

Something is observing the observer.

CREATIVE PRINCIPLE:

The player must initially fall in love with the world.

They must become attached to the astronomer exploring it.

Then they must slowly discover that the beautiful night sky is something they were never meant to observe.

